// moondb: the standard database-access interface for MoonBit — the contract that
// sits between DB drivers and query layers (Go's database/sql/driver, Python's
// DB-API 2.0). Zero dependencies by design: this package is pure and compiles on
// every backend, so the interface everything else pins to never drags a backend
// or an async runtime behind it.

// The doc comments reference `@debug.Repr` through the derived Debug impls; core's
// debug package is a compile-time dependency of the interface, not a runtime one.
import {
  "moonbitlang/core/debug",
}
